# Little Browser: a slot in Chromium's tab list between the pinned and the unpinned tabs, for
# chromium/lb's "+ New Tab" row (docs/ux.md §2: divider, New tab, today's tabs). The row itself
# is ours (lb/browser/ui/views/sidebar/new_tab_row_view.*); sidebar-hooks.patch puts it in. The
# divider above it is Chromium's own pinned/unpinned separator, shown whenever there are pinned
# tabs (upstream shows it only in the collapsed strip).
--- a/chrome/browser/ui/views/tabs/common/tab_strip_view.h
+++ b/chrome/browser/ui/views/tabs/common/tab_strip_view.h
@@ -46,6 +46,11 @@
 
